<Layout title="Privacy & Cookies Policy | Manchester Select"><section class="policy"><div class="eyebrow">Manchester Select</div><h1>Privacy & Cookies Policy</h1><p class="lead">We only collect information we need to respond to enquiries, operate the website and improve the experience where you have chosen optional cookies.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you contact us, we may collect your name, email address, message and sponsorship interest. We use this information to respond to your enquiry and manage Manchester Select activity.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>Essential storage is used for your cookie preference. Optional statistics and marketing categories remain off unless you choose them. We do not use a bloated third-party consent platform.</p><h2>Sharing</h2><p>We do not sell personal information. Where service providers are required to operate the enquiry system, information is shared only as necessary to provide that service.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email hello@manchesterselectrl.co.uk.</p></section></Layout>
